\" to \\\"headphones, noise-cancelling, qa-premium-renamed, qa-added-tag\\\" (removed wireless, renamed premium, added a new tag). Saved with \\\"Product updated successfully\\\". Detail page now shows exactly the 4 new tags. Search \\\"qa-added-tag\\\" → 1 product (Sony); search \\\"wireless\\\" → \\\"0 products found\\\", confirming the removed tag no longer matches.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-7\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Create/Edit form exposes a single-select \\\"Category *\\\" with exactly Tech Gadgets, Home Goods, Fitness. Assigning \\\"Home Goods\\\" to QA Zen Air Purifier saved a single category: the card badge reads \\\"Home\\\" on /products, and /category/home (\\\"Home Goods\\\") now lists it alongside the 3 seeded Home products; it does not appear under Tech or Fitness.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-8\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"On /products, category select offers All Categories/Tech Gadgets/Home Goods/Fitness. Tech Gadgets → \\\"3 products found\\\" (Samsung S24 Ultra, MacBook Pro 14\\\", Sony WH-1000XM5). Fitness → \\\"3 products found\\\" (Bowflex, Theragun Pro, Peloton Bike+). Count and visible cards updated to match.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-9\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"/products shows \\\"9 products found\\\"; each of the 9 article cards exposes name (link+h3), category badge (Tech/Home/Fitness), price ($399…$2,495), star rating + numeric value (e.g. 4.8), brief review paragraph, product image, and a \\\"Buy Now\\\" purchase link.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-10\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Sort=Top Rated → 4.9,4.8,4.7,4.7,4.6,4.6,4.5,4.5,4.4 desc. Price: Low to High → $199→$2,495. Price: High to Low → $2,495→$199. Newest is default. Min rating \\\"4.5+ stars\\\" → 8 products all ≥4.5 (Philips Hue 4.4 excluded). Price Range slider set to $1250 → \\\"3 products found\\\", all ≥$1,299.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-19\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Product additions and edits are not persisted — all admin changes are lost on page reload\", \"actual\": \"Created \\\"QA Minimal Product\\\" (admin list showed 10 products) and edited its price to -500 (\\\"Product updated successfully\\\"). After reloading, /products reported \\\"9 products found\\\" with no QA Minimal Product, /product/qa-minimal-product returned \\\"Product Not Found\\\", and /admin listed only the original 9 seeded products. State is held in memory only (localStorage is empty), so every addition/edit is discarded on reload or in a later session.\", \"evidence\": \"Post-reload admin names: [Sony, Peloton, Dyson, MacBook, Theragun, Philips Hue, Samsung, Bowflex, Breville] = 9\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-11\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"All 9 products show exactly one category badge, each one of Tech (3), Home (3), Fitness (3); homepage category tiles also report 3 products per category = 9 total.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-12\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Tags headphones+coffee → \\\"2 products found\\\": Sony WH-1000XM5 (headphones) and Breville Barista Express (coffee) — OR semantics, each result has ≥1 selected tag. Adding category=Tech Gadgets with same tags and price≥$60 → \\\"1 product found\\\" (Sony), satisfying all active criteria simultaneously. Rating 4.5+ earlier excluded only the 4.4 product.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-20\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Publish validation only enforces name/category/short description; a product can be created with no full review, image, retailer link, or specifications, and can be saved with a negative price\", \"actual\": \"Empty form correctly showed \\\"Please fill in all required fields\\\". However, filling ONLY Product Name (\\\"QA Minimal Product\\\") + default category + Short Description created the product: toast \\\"Product created successfully\\\", product appeared in admin list (10 items) with Full Review empty, Image URL empty, Affiliate Link empty, and zero specification rows. Additionally, editing it to Price = -500 saved successfully (\\\"Product updated successfully\\\") and the admin card rendered \\\"-$500\\\". Only the rating bound is enforced (native min=0/max=5 blocked 9.9); the price input has no min attribute.\", \"evidence\": \"Edit form after create showed empty imageUrl/affiliateLink/Full Review and no spec rows; admin card text after price edit: \\\"TechQA Minimal Product-$5004.5Edit\\\"\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-22\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"/product/does-not-exist-999 → h1 \\\"Product Not Found\\\" with explanatory text and a \\\"Browse All Products\\\" link; no product data rendered. /category/bogus-category → h1 \\\"Category Not Found\\\" with explanatory text; no product cards rendered.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-13\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"All category/sort/rating/price changes on /products updated the card set, order and the \\\"N products found\\\" counter immediately in-place; URL stayed http://localhost:6001/products with no navigation/reload.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-14\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Clicking the Dyson V15 Detect card image on /category/home opened /product/dyson-v15-detect (h1 \\\"Dyson V15 Detect\\\"). Clicking the \\\"Breville Barista Express\\\" name link opened /product/breville-barista-express (h1 \\\"Breville Barista Express\\\"). Both matched the clicked product.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-15\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Buy Now links are absolute external URLs with target=_blank rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" (e.g. https://example.com/dyson-v15, /philips-hue, /breville). Clicking Buy Now on the Dyson detail page opened tab 1 at https://example.com/dyson-v15 (\\\"Example Domain\\\") matching that product.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-21\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Category dropdown on category pages is inert — selecting a different category does not change the active category or the displayed products\", \"actual\": \"On /category/home the toolbar offers a category select showing \\\"Home Goods\\\". Choosing the \\\"Fitness\\\" option (verified via explicit listbox ref) produced no change: URL stayed /category/home, H1 stayed \\\"Home Goods\\\", the select reverted to \\\"Home Goods\\\", and the same 3 Home products (Breville, Philips Hue, Dyson) remained. Repeated twice with the same result. The equivalent select on /products does work.\", \"evidence\": \"Post-click state: {url:\\\"/category/home\\\", h1:\\\"Home Goods\\\", combo:\\\"Home Goods\\\", list:[Breville|Home, Philips Hue|Home, Dyson|Home]}\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-16\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"/product/dyson-v15-detect shows name \\\"Dyson V15 Detect\\\", category badge Home, rating 4.7 with stars, price $749, brief description, full \\\"My Review\\\" section, 4 tags (vacuum, cordless, smart-home, cleaning), \\\"Key Specifications\\\" (Runtime, Bin Volume, Weight, Suction Power, Filtration), product image, and a Buy Now retailer action.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-17\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Sampled details show category-appropriate tags: Dyson V15 (Home) → vacuum, cordless, smart-home, cleaning; Breville (Home) → coffee, espresso, kitchen, appliance; Peloton Bike+ (Fitness) → cardio, cycling, smart-equipment, subscription. Categories on detail pages match the card badges seen in browsing (Home/Home/Fitness). Tag-filter cross-checks agreed with detail tags: headphones→Sony, coffee→Breville, flagship→Samsung.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-18\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Dyson V15 Detect: Home / $749 / 4.7 / same bri